<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">CREATIVE STUDIO</view><view class="row between"><view class="title">先有一段，新声。</view><view class="tag tag-green">{{session.user.points || 0}} 积分</view></view><view wx:if="isDemo" class="demo spaced">当前为离线模板样稿，用于体验流程，并非真实AI生成。</view><view wx:if="session && !session.features.generation" class="notice spaced">创作服务尚未开通，当前不会扣除积分。</view><view wx:if="error" class="error spaced">{{error}}</view>
  <view class="field spaced"><text class="label">想创作什么？</text><picker range="{{types}}" range-key="label" value="{{typeIndex}}" bindchange="type"><view class="select">{{types[typeIndex].label}} · {{types[typeIndex].cost}}积分 ⌄</view></picker></view><view class="field"><text class="label">剧种参考</text><picker range="{{genres}}" value="{{genreIndex}}" bindchange="genre"><view class="select">{{form.genre}} ⌄</view></picker></view><view class="field"><text class="label">创作主题</text><input value="{{form.title}}" data-key="title" bindinput="field" maxlength="60" placeholder="例如：远行的人，在春天归来"/></view><view class="field"><text class="label">人物、场景与情绪</text><textarea value="{{form.scene}}" data-key="scene" bindinput="field" maxlength="600" placeholder="谁在什么地方，想对谁说什么？写下你希望表达的情绪。"/></view><checkbox-group bindchange="consent"><label class="check"><checkbox value="yes" checked="{{form.aiConsent}}" color="#a72d33"/><text>我了解生成内容是创作草稿，曲谱首版仅提供C调4/4拍旋律练习，定谱及演出前须请老师复核。</text></label></checkbox-group><button class="primary" bindtap="generate" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || !session.features.generation}}">生成草稿 · {{types[typeIndex].cost}}积分</button><view class="form-note">失败自动退回积分；不支持充值与现金支付。超过5分钟可在记录中申请超时退回。</view>
  <view wx:if="job" class="card spaced"><view class="tag tag-red">AI辅助创作草稿</view><view class="work-title">{{job.input.title}}</view><view wx:if="job.status === 'completed'"><view class="pre excerpt">{{job.result.lyrics}}</view><view wx:if="job.result.score" class="notice spaced"><view>1=C　4/4　♩={{job.result.score.tempo}}</view><view class="pre spaced">{{notation}}</view></view><view class="form-note">{{job.result.notes}}</view><view class="actions"><button class="secondary" bindtap="exportText">导出TXT</button><button wx:if="job.result.score" class="secondary" bindtap="exportScore">导出MusicXML</button></view><button class="primary spaced" bindtap="submitDraft">带入投稿，继续打磨</button></view><view wx:elif="job.status === 'failed'" class="notice">{{job.error}}</view><view wx:else><view class="muted">生成处理中，可稍后刷新查看。</view><button class="secondary spaced" bindtap="recover">检查超时并退回积分</button></view></view>
  <view class="section-title">我的创作记录</view><view wx:for="{{jobs}}" wx:key="id" class="card row between" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="selectJob"><view class="grow"><view>{{item.input.title}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.provider}}</view></view><text class="tag">{{item.stateText}}</text></view><view wx:if="!jobs.length" class="empty">每一份草稿都会保存在这里。</view>
</view>
